# TinyCoder PWA Starter — License Summary

This file summarizes the license tiers. The binding terms for each purchase
are those shown on the Gumroad product page at the time of purchase. Where
this file and the Gumroad page differ, the Gumroad page wins.

## Basic ($29) and Pro ($49)
- Use the template in your OWN projects, including commercial products you
  own and operate (your SaaS, your client-free portfolio, your own apps).
- You may NOT use Basic/Pro for client work, and you may NOT resell,
  redistribute, sublicense, or share the template source itself.

## Agency ($79)
- Everything in Pro, PLUS: use in client projects and sell finished
  products built on the template under your own brand (white-label).
- You may NOT resell or redistribute the template itself as a template,
  starter kit, or boilerplate competing product.

## Free tool (PWA JSON Formatter, $0)
- Free for personal and commercial use. No attribution required.

## Refunds
- 30-day money-back guarantee on paid tiers. Contact via your Gumroad
  purchase receipt email.
